test_*.py
benchmark_*.py
fire_test_passes.py
experiments/
tools/
test_wm_output/

# Documentation
docs/
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# Recovery / temp
_recovery_sessions/
Upload Stats Check/

# Session data (lives on persistent disk, not in image)
data/sessions/

# Claude Code
.claude/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
